@@text
@@text Client run, not a scratch server: a throwaway client window opens on DISPLAY :1 for about an hour (no other game
@@text JVM may run; `eval_client.py launch` refuses). Targets the instance's `mods/` and `resourcepacks/` as they are at the
@@text run. Offline first: `python3 tools/perf/rpack/selftest/run_selftest.py` (4/4 PASS). G = a scratchpad dir.
