## SQ-RPI-08 | Apple Pie benefits left in its config: warning at boot, no max-health bonus applied
@group A
@commands Stop. In the world's `serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml` set `thresholds = [0.0]`, `benefitsUnparsed = ["attribute,generic.max_health,4"]`, `minFoodsToActivate = 0`; boot; bot joins; `/attribute <name> minecraft:generic.max_health get`; `/data get entity <name> Attributes` (#33)
@pass boot log has the INFO note `Apple Pie settings: Apple Pie's own benefit list is not empty; Raspberry Pie keeps it off (its ladder replaces it)`; max health 20; no attribute modifier named `..._modifier_...` (Apple Pie would add 4 at login without the fix)
@fails `BenefitsHandlerMixin` (`updateBenefits`, `tickBenefits`)
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1115/p9_a1b.qb
# r1123rp 2026-11-23: edit and restart in the row (restores the ladder broken by SQ-RPI-04); the warning was reworded to an
# INFO note in plan_rp_standalone.md P5 (ApplePieSettings)
edit L=$(sed -n "s/^level-name=//p" server.properties); F="$L/serverconfig/solraspberrypie/ladder.json"; test -f "$F.orig" && cp "$F.orig" "$F"; T="$L/serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml"; sed -i -E 's/^(\s*)thresholds = .*/\1thresholds = [0.0]/; s/^(\s*)benefitsUnparsed = .*/\1benefitsUnparsed = ["attribute,generic.max_health,4"]/; s/^(\s*)minFoodsToActivate = .*/\1minFoodsToActivate = 0/' "$T" && grep -nE "^\s*(thresholds|benefitsUnparsed|minFoodsToActivate) " "$T"
restart
bootexpect Apple Pie settings: Apple Pie's own benefit list is not empty; Raspberry Pie keeps it off
bootexpect Diet ladder: [0-9]+ rungs, 5 slots
> forceload add 0 990 40 1010
> pbot spawn rp8 22 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> pbot spawn rp7 10 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> attribute rp8 minecraft:generic.max_health get
> attribute rp7 minecraft:generic.max_health get
> data get entity rp8 Attributes
> data get entity rp7 Attributes
sleep 1
count Value of attribute .* for (entity )?rp[78] is 20\.0 == 2
# BF-FIX r1123rp 2026-11-23: the restart puts the whole boot log in the row segment (a dynamicvillagertrades
# placement_modifier line matched); scope the reject to the entity data replies
reject has the following entity data: .*_modifier_
look rp8 (new) and rp7 (has eaten): max health 20, no Apple Pie modifier in Attributes

