@commands Fresh world; `grep -n "Diet ladder" logs/latest.log`
@pass `Diet ladder: 83 rungs, 5 slots, 39 pool effects` (fewer only if a listed mod is missing, then one `skipped N entries` warning naming them); no `toggle:` warning; no V3, V4, V5, V6 or V10 warning (Satiated, `minecraft:saturation`, at 100 is allowed); at diversity 100 Saturation is applied and hunger stays full
