## CQ-RPI-94 | Fleet-Footed config carry-over: fleetFootedFov moves from Raspberry Pie to Creative Compat (raspberry-pie-publish #25)
@group client
@commands put `tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/old_solraspberrypie-client.toml` (fleetFootedFov 0.5) as `config/solraspberrypie-client.toml` with no `[fleet_footed]` in `config/creativecompat-common.toml`; start the client; read both files and the log; then give Fleet-Footed and sprint-jump
@pass Compat's toml has `[fleet_footed]` `fov = 0.5`; Raspberry Pie's file no longer has `fleetFootedFov`; log has `[swaps] config [effects] fleetFootedFov = 0.5 carried over`; the view shift matches 0.5
