@reviewed 2026-11-24
# launch: run_captures.py serve --config solraspberrypie-client.toml:effects:fleetFootedFov=0.5 on a game dir whose
# config/ is a fresh copy of the instance's (no [fleet_footed] in creativecompat-common.toml, 2026-11-24); a reused game dir
# where Compat already wrote [fleet_footed] skips the carry (the bootexpect fails: re-run setup)
bootexpect \[swaps\] config \[effects\] fleetFootedFov = 0\.5 carried over from solraspberrypie-client\.toml to creativecompat-common\.toml \[fleet_footed\] fov
bootreject \[creativecompat\] (could not carry fleetFootedFov|config/\S+ still has \[effects\] fleetFootedFov)
shell awk '/^\[fleet_footed\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativecompat-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*fov = 0\.5\s*$'
shell ! grep -n 'fleetFootedFov' config/solraspberrypie-client.toml
> gamemode survival
> time set noon
> fill -4 99 -4 4 99 40 minecraft:stone
> fill -4 100 -4 4 104 40 minecraft:air
> effect give @s alexsmobs:fleet_footed 120 0 true
do {"look": {"from": "0.5 101.62 0.5", "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0}}
do {"fly": false}
do {"effects": true, "expect": "alexsmobs:fleet_footed"}
do {"walk": 6, "keys": "forward sprint", "after": 0}
shot sprint_ground
do {"walk": 8, "keys": "forward sprint jump", "after": 0}
shot sprint_jump
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|effect)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command)
look shots: the sprint_jump view is only slightly wider than sprint_ground (fov 0.5 = half the Fleet-Footed shift); the feel is the owner's live check (CQ-RPI-76)
## CQ-RPI-95 | Fleet-Footed fix with two players and the FOV, now Compat's (food-tuning #43, #55; raspberry-pie-publish #25)
@group client
@commands rerun CQ-RPI-26 and CQ-RPI-76 with Creative Compat installed; the FOV key is `[fleet_footed] fov` in `config/creativecompat-common.toml`
@pass as CQ-RPI-26 and CQ-RPI-76 (no walker modifier while the other jumps; fov 1.0 = vanilla shift)
@fails `FleetFootedMixin` and `FleetFootedFov` in `creativecompat/mobs/`, gate in `CompatMixinPlugin` (alexsmobs [1.21.1,1.22) plus the member check)
@draft needs two real players (the walker modifier appears on one player while the other jumps): run_captures.py serve drives one client; a second client or a client-side bot is not in the tooling (2026-11-24). The FOV half is CQ-RPI-94
@reviewed 2026-11-24
## SQ-RPI-96 | Raspberry Pie alone without Compat: boots clean, no Fleet-Footed fix (W2-3 accepted)
@group A (Raspberry Pie + Alex's Mobs, no Compat)
@commands boot Raspberry Pie with Alex's Mobs and without Creative Compat; grep latest.log for `FleetFooted` and mixin errors
@pass boots to `Done (`; no `FleetFootedMixin` error or warning from Raspberry Pie; no Fleet-Footed fix applied (accepted loss)
@fails a leftover Raspberry Pie reference to `FleetFootedMixin` or `fleetFootedFov`
@modset rps alex
@reviewed 2026-11-24
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject InvalidInjectionException|MixinApplyError|Mixin apply.*solraspberrypie.*failed|Fleet-Footed fix (is off|failed)
bootreject (?i)(FleetFootedMixin|fleetFootedFov|EffectFleetFooted)
shell ! ls mods | grep -iE '^creativecompat-'
shell ls mods | grep -iE '^alexsmobs-'
shell n=$(unzip -l mods/solRaspberryPie-*.jar | grep -ci 'fleetfooted'); echo fleetfooted_entries=$n; [ "$n" = 0 ]
shell grep -n -i 'fleet' config/solraspberrypie-*.toml; true
